    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HDHE4TN5QRBCW0NJE3XPEREW\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to create a segment of all of your opted-in SMS contacts. </p>\n<p>Bringing your SMS subscribers into one segment is important to trigger flows, create campaigns, and gather business insights. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDHE4TN5M2X9YGSQ4XVFBR8C\">Build an SMS subscribers segment</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Audience &gt; </strong><strong>Lists &amp; segments</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create List/Segment &gt; Segment</strong>.</li>\n<li>Name your segment.</li>\n<li>Add the following segment definition: <br><strong>If someone can or cannot receive marketing &gt; can receive &gt; SMS marketing</strong><br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28722556925979\" alt=\"New condition to identify profiles that are consented to SMS\" width=\"571\" height=\"204\">\n</li>\n<li>Save the segment.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You'll now have a segment of everyone who is currently opted in to SMS. </p>\n<div class=\"accordion accordion--default\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item-title\">\n<h4 id=\"h_01HDHE4TN5PY5EMAJEAR59QKFC\">Using the segment in Klaviyo</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion__item-content\">\n<p>Once you’re done creating that segment, you can target a sign-up form for when a subscriber is on your site. If you add a condition where someone has joined your SMS marketing in the last two weeks, you can display relevant, on-site information about your texting program or remind them of a deal that you may have sent to them.</p>\n<p>You can also use this segment to send a campaign. For instance, you can tell your SMS subscribers about a flash sale.</p>\n<p>Lastly, you can use this segment to gain business insight into how your SMS marketing is performing. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDHE4TN6NQ78WXX01P4KNP1B\"> Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260806260849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Review and understand your SMS deliverability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6155416998555\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to clean your SMS lists</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.klaviyo.com/blog/sms-marketing-strategies\">SMS marketing strategies for all levels [+12 Pro tips]</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
